      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Subject router → picks the model per subject\n•  composeSession()  —  60/20/20 plan in ~50 ms\n•  BKT mastery  (fluid at P(L) ≥ 0.85)          ● live\n•  IRT-2PL  +  fatigue / cognitive-load monitor   ● live\n•  IRT-3PL · PFA · Glicko-2 · DINA                 ○ shadow\n•  Wrong-answer guards · free-tier Topic Browser",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Subject router → picks the model per subject\n•  composeSession()  —  60/20/20 plan in ~50 ms\n•  BKT mastery  (fluid at P(L) ≥ 0.85)          ● live\n•  IRT-2PL  +  fatigue / cognitive-load monitor   ● live\n•  IRT-3PL · PFA · Glicko-2 · DINA                 ○ shadow\n•  Wrong-answer guards · free-tier Topic Browser",
      "autoResize": true,
