      "seed": 2042042741,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1311874555,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783768679671,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  PgBouncer  →  PostgreSQL + pgvector\n     'the Ledger' — system of record\n     identity/billing · learning · content · telemetry\n     (39 tables · 90-day partitions)\n\n•  Neo4j  —  'the GPS' knowledge graph\n     473 techniques · prerequisites · traps\n\n•  Redis  —  caches · match state · flags\n\n•  Cold Parquet archive (DigitalOcean, 2 yr)\n•  pg_cron  —  refreshes KPI views / 15 min",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  PgBouncer  →  PostgreSQL + pgvector\n     'the Ledger' — system of record\n     identity/billing · learning · content · telemetry\n     (39 tables · 90-day partitions)\n\n•  Neo4j  —  'the GPS' knowledge graph\n     473 techniques · prerequisites · traps\n\n•  Redis  —  caches · match state · flags\n\n•  Cold Parquet archive (DigitalOcean, 2 yr)\n•  pg_cron  —  refreshes KPI views / 15 min",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
